> > > reliably to (at least) macOS Sierra, Windows 10 14393, Android
> > > 6.0.1, 7.0, and 7.1.1 (including devices using 3.10 and 3.18
> > > based kernels).
> > > 
> > > I'm happy to collect logs, test other patches, etc.
> > 
